# Principles Before Personalities: launch listing drafts

Drafted by SEO on 2026-09-25. **Nothing here has been posted or sent.** James posts each one himself, from his own accounts, if and when he wants to.

Before posting anything:

- Every listing says it is **free**, uses the **public-domain 1939 first edition** text, and carries the line **"Not affiliated with or endorsed by Alcoholics Anonymous World Services, Inc."** Keep those three things if you edit.
- Don't call it the current or fourth edition. Don't call the iPhone version an App Store app (it's an installable web app).
- Post each place once. No ratings, upvote requests or "tell your friends to upvote".
- Links: site `https://principles-before-personalities.netlify.app/`, iPhone web app `https://principles-before-personalities.netlify.app/iphone/`, chapter page `https://principles-before-personalities.netlify.app/big-book-chapters/`.
- Submit pages were checked on 2026-09-25 (each loaded; most need you to log in first). MacUpdate's old developer page returned 404, so it was left out.

