## 1. AlternativeTo

Submit page: https://alternativeto.net/manage-item/ (log in first; the old `/software/new/` address now redirects here)

- **Name:** Principles Before Personalities
- **Website:** https://principles-before-personalities.netlify.app/
- **License / price:** Free
- **Platforms:** Mac, Windows, Android, Web (iPhone web app)
- **Category / tags:** Ebook reader, Reading, Note-taking, Offline, Privacy
- **Short description (one line):**
  Free offline reader for the public-domain 1939 Big Book, with highlights, bookmarks, sticky notes and search. No account.
- **Full description:**
  Principles Before Personalities is a free, distraction-free reader for the public-domain 1939 first edition of *Alcoholics Anonymous* (the "Big Book") and its personal stories. The text uses the page numbers read in meetings, and you can type a page number to jump to it. You can highlight in five colors, mark pages, drop sticky notes on a page, search the full text, and import your own .txt or .md files. Everything is stored on your own device: no account, no network connection needed, no telemetry. Available for Mac (macOS 14+), Windows 10/11, Android (.apk, sideloaded) and iPhone (an installable web app added from Safari, not an App Store app).
  Not affiliated with or endorsed by Alcoholics Anonymous World Services, Inc.
- **Alternative to:** only pick apps that really are Big Book or ebook readers. Check each one's page before linking.

